### ==========================================
### TRADING ROUTES (/user-api)
### Replace <USER_ID> and <STOCK_ID> with actuals
### Login as TRADER first
### ==========================================

### Buy stock
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "<USER_ID>",
    "stockId": "<STOCK_ID>",
    "quantity": 5
}

### Buy more of the same stock (tests avgBuyPrice recalculation)
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "<USER_ID>",
    "stockId": "<STOCK_ID>",
    "quantity": 3
}

### Buy a different stock
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "<USER_ID>",
    "stockId": "<STOCK_ID_2>",
    "quantity": 2
}

### Sell stock (partial)
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/sell
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "<USER_ID>",
    "stockId": "<STOCK_ID>",
    "quantity": 2
}

### Sell stock (all remaining — should remove from portfolio)
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/sell
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "<USER_ID>",
    "stockId": "<STOCK_ID>",
    "quantity": 6
}

### --- ERROR CASES ---

### Buy with insufficient balance
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "<USER_ID>",
    "stockId": "<STOCK_ID>",
    "quantity": 99999
}

### Sell more than owned
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/sell
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "<USER_ID>",
    "stockId": "<STOCK_ID>",
    "quantity": 99999
}

### Buy with invalid stock ID
POST http://localhost:5000/user-api/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "<USER_ID>",
    "stockId": "000000000000000000000000",
    "quantity": 1
}

### --- PORTFOLIO & HISTORY ---

### Get user portfolio (with P/L)
GET http://localhost:5000/user-api/portfolio/<USER_ID>

### Get user transaction history
GET http://localhost:5000/user-api/transactions/<USER_ID>
